{"id":"n27858-1-11","stage":3,"title":"취재 · 采访","scene":"社会与交往","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n27858-1-11-1","ko":"이 잡지 정말 재미있는 기사가 많아요.","zh":"这本杂志里有好多有趣的文章呢。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"이","meaning":"这，这个","explanation":"이：这，这个","readings":[{"term":"이","audio":"/audio/8bafb6b7d17ead4985bf.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71687","senseId":"1","lemma":"이","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"이","audio":"/audio/8bafb6b7d17ead4985bf.mp3"}},{"text":"잡지","meaning":"杂志","explanation":"잡지：杂志","readings":[{"term":"잡지","audio":"/audio/d6064de0a471787155ef.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62518","senseId":"1","lemma":"잡지","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"잡지","audio":"/audio/d6064de0a471787155ef.mp3"}},{"text":"정말","meaning":"真的","explanation":"정말：真的","readings":[{"term":"정말","audio":"/audio/6f24e21fc8cce6bd9e56.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61173","senseId":"3","lemma":"정말","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"정말","audio":"/audio/6f24e21fc8cce6bd9e56.mp3"}},{"text":"재미있는","meaning":"有趣，有意思","explanation":"재미있다：有趣，有意思；-는：将前面的动作或状态转为修饰名词的形式。","readings":[{"term":"재미있다","audio":"/audio/e2360d9fd7642ddd6242.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71212","senseId":"1","lemma":"재미있다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"재미있는","audio":"/audio/f963495a3d81a4c95b50.mp3"}},{"text":"기사가","meaning":"报道，新闻","explanation":"기사：报道，新闻；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"기사","audio":"/audio/1f896d183072b81262d9.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17231","senseId":"1","lemma":"기사","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"기사가","audio":"/audio/8de994f35f85bc9448d0.mp3"}},{"text":"많아요.","meaning":"多，丰富，强","explanation":"많다：多，丰富，强；어요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"많다","audio":"/audio/b30b4bf6ab97d6a55225.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"69295","senseId":"1","lemma":"많다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"많아요","audio":"/audio/e2d2cc074c8e28c555ca.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"8bafb6b7d17ead49","term":"이","zh":"这，这个","audio":"/audio/8bafb6b7d17ead4985bf.mp3","entryId":"71687","definition":"用于指示与话者离得近的物品，或用于指示话者所想的对象。","pronunciation":["이"]},{"id":"d6064de0a4717871","term":"잡지","zh":"杂志","audio":"/audio/d6064de0a471787155ef.mp3","entryId":"62518","definition":"定期发行的书，有各种内容的新闻、照片、广告等。","pronunciation":["잡찌"]},{"id":"6f24e21fc8cce6bd","term":"정말","zh":"真的","audio":"/audio/6f24e21fc8cce6bd9e56.mp3","entryId":"61173","definition":"用于强调自己所说的话。","pronunciation":["정ː말"]},{"id":"e2360d9fd7642ddd","term":"재미있다","zh":"有趣，有意思","audio":"/audio/e2360d9fd7642ddd6242.mp3","entryId":"71212","definition":"有欢欣愉悦的感觉。","pronunciation":["재미읻따"]},{"id":"1f896d183072b812","term":"기사","zh":"报道，新闻","audio":"/audio/1f896d183072b81262d9.mp3","entryId":"17231","definition":"报纸或杂志等上报告某种事实的文章。","pronunciation":["기사"]},{"id":"b30b4bf6ab97d6a5","term":"많다","zh":"多，丰富，强","audio":"/audio/b30b4bf6ab97d6a55225.mp3","entryId":"69295","definition":"数、量、程度等超过一定标准。","pronunciation":["만ː타"]}],"audio":"/audio/8589d64da983a42c7c45.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n27858-1-11-2","ko":"그 잡지요? 들은 얘기인데, 취재에 공을 많이 들인대요.","zh":"那本杂志吗？我听说他们在采访上花了很大功夫呢。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"그","meaning":"那个","explanation":"그：那个","readings":[{"term":"그","audio":"/audio/38c61820e786f2346e96.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"43883","senseId":"1","lemma":"그","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"그","audio":"/audio/38c61820e786f2346e96.mp3"}},{"text":"잡지요?","meaning":"杂志","explanation":"잡지：杂志；요：增加礼貌语气。","readings":[{"term":"잡지","audio":"/audio/d6064de0a471787155ef.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62518","senseId":"1","lemma":"잡지","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"잡지요","audio":"/audio/cfcbbb8cb712ae9a1de1.mp3"}},{"text":"들은","meaning":"听说","explanation":"듣다：听说；은：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"듣다","audio":"/audio/58977b8705722edc164c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"74104","senseId":"4","lemma":"듣다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"들은","audio":"/audio/61c083631878e71b5162.mp3"}},{"text":"얘기인데,","meaning":"消息","explanation":"얘기：消息；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；ㄴ데：先交代背景，再引出后文的转折、补充、请求或问题。","readings":[{"term":"얘기","audio":"/audio/cbb7c3fe2dd88ddc7d2b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"74194","senseId":"4","lemma":"얘기","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"얘기인데","audio":"/audio/d7e5b30463330ffbe502.mp3"}},{"text":"취재에","meaning":"采访，取材","explanation":"취재：采访，取材；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"취재","audio":"/audio/53739ce32e46b8812a09.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27858","senseId":"1","lemma":"취재","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"취재에","audio":"/audio/7a782cd4f3ea23f0bcc3.mp3"}},{"text":"공을","meaning":"功夫、精力","explanation":"공：付出的努力、功夫（공을 들이다：下功夫）；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"공","audio":"/audio/396159745e203d0de79f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"93433","senseId":"1","lemma":"공","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"공을","audio":"/audio/9d758f4340bdff23ef7e.mp3"}},{"text":"많이","meaning":"多","explanation":"많이：多","readings":[{"term":"많이","audio":"/audio/1af2aeb1be04021c7be5.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66030","senseId":"1","lemma":"많이","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"많이","audio":"/audio/1af2aeb1be04021c7be5.mp3"}},{"text":"들인대요.","meaning":"花费，付出","explanation":"들이다：花费，付出；ㄴ대요：口语中礼貌地转述听来的话。","readings":[{"term":"들이다","audio":"/audio/d301b4f8af6e22a42158.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"15078","senseId":"9","lemma":"들이다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"들인대요","audio":"/audio/2857261050142feeedcc.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"38c61820e786f234","term":"그","zh":"那个","audio":"/audio/38c61820e786f2346e96.mp3","entryId":"43883","definition":"指代与听话人较近或听话人所想的对象。","pronunciatio